blis: BLIS is a portable software framework for instantiating
blis: high-performance BLAS-like dense linear algebra libraries.
blis: The framework was designed to isolate essential computational
blis: kernels that, when optimized, enable fast implementations of
blis: BLAS operations.
blis:
